{"subject_id": "9014701", "chunk_id": "6f19035f492b", "area": "event_area", "context_heading": "储能产业动态", "date_hint": "2024年9月27日", "global_order": 13, "source": "detail_html", "created_at": "2026-04-02T15:01:49", "source_id": "detail_9014701_0", "order": 13, "used_fallback": false, "event_date_raw": "2024年9月27日", "text": "近日，第九届（2024）国际储能和电池技术及装备（上海）大会暨展览会（“SNEC ES+ 2024国际储能两会”）在上海举办。"}
